CSS supports140+ color names, HEX values, RGB values, RGBA 
values, HSL values, HSLA values, and opacity.

RGBA color values are an extension ofRGB colorswith an alpha channel - which specifies the opacity 
for a color.

An RGBA color value is 
specified with:

rgba(red,green,blue, 
alpha)

The alpha parameter is a number between 0.0 
(fully transparent) and 1.0 (fully opaque).

